(6937033, 1045539, 119863, '<td valign="top">The way this photo captures the whole valley and splays it out in front of you is great.  The fog flopped into the bottom like pancake batter inching outward, taken from a highpoint towards the flat horizon instead of the other way around makes the photo feel like a big reveal after a long trek to summit.  All around approval from me.</td>', 'The way this photo captures the whole valley and splays it out in front of you is great.  The fog flopped into the bottom like pancake batter inching outward, taken from a highpoint towards the flat horizon instead of the other way around makes the photo feel like a big reveal after a long trek to summit.  All around approval from me.', '2012-12-19 04:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
