(6938333, 1045372, 155989, '<td valign="top">A basset is indeed a hound although not technically a hound dog in Southern venacular being a pure breed. The hound dog in the song is used to illustrate the lack of breeding of the lady in question as she is not ''high class'' or well bred.</td>', 'A basset is indeed a hound although not technically a hound dog in Southern venacular being a pure breed. The hound dog in the song is used to illustrate the lack of breeding of the lady in question as she is not ''high class'' or well bred.', '2012-12-20 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
