(6938340, 1045066, 155989, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this image in grey or blue tones. The green is just a bit too fertile and optimistic even though rain does make everything nice and green. It just somehow doesn''t convey ''rain, rain, rain, rain'' to me.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this image in grey or blue tones. The green is just a bit too fertile and optimistic even though rain does make everything nice and green. It just somehow doesn''t convey ''rain, rain, rain, rain'' to me.', '2012-12-20 17:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
