(6941994, 1045539, 112739, '<td valign="top">Mine dropped from a 7.30. Voter scrubber. I was thinking this image would be for Blue. It''s a fantastic landscape with the light and low hanging clouds. Congrats on a new PB and the Red!</td>', 'Mine dropped from a 7.30. Voter scrubber. I was thinking this image would be for Blue. It''s a fantastic landscape with the light and low hanging clouds. Congrats on a new PB and the Red!', '2012-12-26 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6942005, 1045592, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! When did you get the TS-E? Isn''t it wonderful?<br/> <br/>What you''re calling "some distortion in the clouds" isn''t, really./ It''s important to make a distinction between the apparent elongation of shapes at the edge of the visual field and actual distortions brought about by a lens. You have to realize that the angular coverage of the 17mm TS-E is REALLY extreme, much more than a conventional 17mm. When you''re shifting out to the edge of the image circle, that''s more like wjat you''d be seeing on the periphery of a 10mm conventional WA on your FF sensor.</td>', 'Fantastic! When did you get the TS-E? Isn''t it wonderful? What you''re calling "some distortion in the clouds" isn''t, really./ It''s important to make a distinction between the apparent elongation of shapes at the edge of the visual field and actual distortions brought about by a lens. You have to realize that the angular coverage of the 17mm TS-E is REALLY extreme, much more than a conventional 17mm. When you''re shifting out to the edge of the image circle, that''s more like wjat you''d be seeing on the periphery of a 10mm conventional WA on your FF sensor.', '2012-12-26 11:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6942006, 1045539, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well done, Giles. Getting the hang of that HDR, ain''tcha?</td>', 'Well done, Giles. Getting the hang of that HDR, ain''tcha?', '2012-12-26 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6942010, 1045592, 137576, '<td valign="top">This was in my top 3 with a 9, I spent an hour reading about the tse 17mm this morning looks like a great lens, I see gyaban dominates with it on here apart from a pic from you and bear. This is an intriguing looking place, great to have it to your almost self. Congratulations on the well deserved blue.</td>', 'This was in my top 3 with a 9, I spent an hour reading about the tse 17mm this morning looks like a great lens, I see gyaban dominates with it on here apart from a pic from you and bear. This is an intriguing looking place, great to have it to your almost self. Congratulations on the well deserved blue.', '2012-12-26 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6942032, 1045621, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 which is my vote for a decent, but not overwhelming picture.  The bokeh is nice and the subject provides a nice diagonal for the eye to follow.  The color burning (I assume that''s what it is) is a bit too peachy to my eyes compared to the overall tones of the plants.  It''s also borderline illegal, although I can never keep straight what is legal these days for vignettes.<br/> <br/>The reason this didn''t do much better is there isn''t too much connection to offer the viewer.  We don''t get drawn into the image because of a story or because of interest or because of a human element.  You see the majority of your shot''s scores are 5 and 6.  You didn''t get many below because it was technically well done.  You didn''t get many above because it didn''t have a soul.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 which is my vote for a decent, but not overwhelming picture.  The bokeh is nice and the subject provides a nice diagonal for the eye to follow.  The color burning (I assume that''s what it is) is a bit too peachy to my eyes compared to the overall tones of the plants.  It''s also borderline illegal, although I can never keep straight what is legal these days for vignettes. The reason this didn''t do much better is there isn''t too much connection to offer the viewer.  We don''t get drawn into the image because of a story or because of interest or because of a human element.  You see the majority of your shot''s scores are 5 and 6.  You didn''t get many below because it was technically well done.  You didn''t get many above because it didn''t have a soul.', '2012-12-26 12:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
