(6942363, 1045735, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Glad to see this did well. Very clever, smart humor. Love the glow. So... about that hat... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry, the hat isn''t complete.  As I was trying to complete it, government operatives broke into my house and shorted my roll of aluminum foil.  I only managed to protect the frontal lobes... my rear was completely exposed!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Glad to see this did well. Very clever, smart humor. Love the glow. So... about that hat...   Sorry, the hat isn''t complete.  As I was trying to complete it, government operatives broke into my house and shorted my roll of aluminum foil.  I only managed to protect the frontal lobes... my rear was completely exposed!!!', '2012-12-26 23:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
