(6942427, 1045636, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mrchhas:</b></div><hr/><i> has a clockwork orange feel to it </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Several people thought it.  <br/> <br/>I''m pretty happy that some of you liked very much this one. I like to experiment new things. Surely it''s a very different/strange angle/style than usual for me but that''s what I like in this! I made a huge mistake cloning out the reflection of the studio flashes in the eye - with them the eye shape had much more depth.</td>', 'Originally posted by mrchhas: has a clockwork orange feel to it   Several people thought it.   I''m pretty happy that some of you liked very much this one. I like to experiment new things. Surely it''s a very different/strange angle/style than usual for me but that''s what I like in this! I made a huge mistake cloning out the reflection of the studio flashes in the eye - with them the eye shape had much more depth.', '2012-12-27 03:59:04.000000', NULL, 0);
