(7160114, 1045692, 58667, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by herfotoman:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice setup. Why cut off the hand? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I certainly did not want to but that''s the absolute height limit I had - the shadows at the top of the image are of the curtain rail. I didn''t have enough space to create the scene as I wanted. I could have cropped more off the arm to avoid the avulsion, but I needed the photo to look as long as possible for the pose (I am a lot broader than Elvis Presley was).<br/> <br/>I was trying to resemble this while dancing with a wooden chair: <img alt="'' . substr(''//3.bp.blogspot.com/_uej3fplVReE/TSecaa5k_hI/AAAAAAAAACU/aCJQiNE4wbg/s320/jail_house_rock.jpg'', strrpos(''//3.bp.blogspot.com/_uej3fplVReE/TSecaa5k_hI/AAAAAAAAACU/aCJQiNE4wbg/s320/jail_house_rock.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//3.bp.blogspot.com/_uej3fplVReE/TSecaa5k_hI/AAAAAAAAACU/aCJQiNE4wbg/s320/jail_house_rock.jpg"/></td>', 'Originally posted by herfotoman: Nice setup. Why cut off the hand?   I certainly did not want to but that''s the absolute height limit I had - the shadows at the top of the image are of the curtain rail. I didn''t have enough space to create the scene as I wanted. I could have cropped more off the arm to avoid the avulsion, but I needed the photo to look as long as possible for the pose (I am a lot broader than Elvis Presley was). I was trying to resemble this while dancing with a wooden chair: ', '2014-01-20 03:14:54.000000', NULL, 0);
